    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Genre:</strong> Strategy / Tower Defense / Historical Simulation</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build, Defend, and Reign Supreme in Feudal Japan!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the role of a legendary daimyo in <i>Japanese Castle Strategy Zundamon Castle</i>, a unique blend of tactical warfare, historical simulation, and castle-building strategy. Command your armies, design your perfect fortress, and repel waves of invading forces using traditional Japanese buildings, clever formations, and cunning tactics.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udee1 <strong>Authentic Japanese Castle-Building</strong><br>Craft your own fortress with moats, stone walls, watchtowers. Every design choice matters\u2014one weak point could spell your downfall!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2694 <strong>Real-Time Tactical Battles</strong><br>Lead your troops in large-scale battles inspired by feudal-era Japan. Time your commands carefully and adapt to changing battlefield conditions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfad <strong>Zundamon Joins the Fight!</strong><br>Zundamon, the adorable and mysterious castle guardian, brings unique abilities and unexpected humor to the front lines. Rally her powers to protect your stronghold!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\uddfe <strong>Historical Meets Fantasy</strong><br>Experience the perfect fusion of history and imagination. While the characters and story include mythical elements and original creations, the game world is grounded in reality\u2014featuring detailed, authentic Japanese landscapes generated using official geospatial data from the Geospatial Information Authority of Japan (GSI). Build and battle on realistic terrain that mirrors actual regions of Japan, adding a new layer of depth to your strategic planning.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2455610/extras/fe586e65842be16d91bde0b059f46f95.avif?t=1749127555\" /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Who Are Tohoku Kiritan and Zundamon?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tohoku Kiritan and Zundamon are regional characters created by a Japanese company called SSS LLC in 2011, the same year as the Great East Japan Earthquake. They were designed to promote and support the revitalization of the Tohoku region.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Zundamon, in particular, gained massive popularity in Japan after a free synthetic voice based on the character was released in 2021. Since then, they've become widely known through voiceover videos on platforms like YouTube and have built a strong fanbase across the country.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Voxel Castle Builder: Kiritan Castle</i> is a fan-made game where these beloved characters take center stage. But don\u2019t worry\u2014no prior knowledge of Kiritan or Zundamon is needed to enjoy the game. It\u2019s designed to be fun and accessible for everyone, whether you're a longtime fan or meeting them for the first time!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2455610/extras/7d315c4768a5b9755d9bdba7a507e8c9.poster.avif?t=1749127555\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2455610/extras/7d315c4768a5b9755d9bdba7a507e8c9.webm?t=1749127555\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2455610/extras/7d315c4768a5b9755d9bdba7a507e8c9.mp4?t=1749127555\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2455610/extras/11ca3cc38e87e45dab528f152b402df6.poster.avif?t=1749127555\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2455610/extras/11ca3cc38e87e45dab528f152b402df6.webm?t=1749127555\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2455610/extras/11ca3cc38e87e45dab528f152b402df6.mp4?t=1749127555\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Genre:</strong> Strategy / Tower Defense / Historical Simulation</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build, Defend, and Reign Supreme in Feudal Japan!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the role of a legendary daimyo in <i>Japanese Castle Strategy Zundamon Castle</i>, a unique blend of tactical warfare, historical simulation, and castle-building strategy. Command your armies, design your perfect fortress, and repel waves of invading forces using traditional Japanese buildings, clever formations, and cunning tactics.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udee1 <strong>Authentic Japanese Castle-Building</strong><br>Craft your own fortress with moats, stone walls, watchtowers. Every design choice matters\u2014one weak point could spell your downfall!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2694 <strong>Real-Time Tactical Battles</strong><br>Lead your troops in large-scale battles inspired by feudal-era Japan. Time your commands carefully and adapt to changing battlefield conditions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfad <strong>Zundamon Joins the Fight!</strong><br>Zundamon, the adorable and mysterious castle guardian, brings unique abilities and unexpected humor to the front lines. Rally her powers to protect your stronghold!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\uddfe <strong>Historical Meets Fantasy</strong><br>Experience the perfect fusion of history and imagination. While the characters and story include mythical elements and original creations, the game world is grounded in reality\u2014featuring detailed, authentic Japanese landscapes generated using official geospatial data from the Geospatial Information Authority of Japan (GSI). Build and battle on realistic terrain that mirrors actual regions of Japan, adding a new layer of depth to your strategic planning.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2455610/extras/fe586e65842be16d91bde0b059f46f95.avif?t=1749127555\" /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Who Are Tohoku Kiritan and Zundamon?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tohoku Kiritan and Zundamon are regional characters created by a Japanese company called SSS LLC in 2011, the same year as the Great East Japan Earthquake. They were designed to promote and support the revitalization of the Tohoku region.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Zundamon, in particular, gained massive popularity in Japan after a free synthetic voice based on the character was released in 2021. Since then, they've become widely known through voiceover videos on platforms like YouTube and have built a strong fanbase across the country.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Voxel Castle Builder: Kiritan Castle</i> is a fan-made game where these beloved characters take center stage. But don\u2019t worry\u2014no prior knowledge of Kiritan or Zundamon is needed to enjoy the game. It\u2019s designed to be fun and accessible for everyone, whether you're a longtime fan or meeting them for the first time!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2455610/extras/7d315c4768a5b9755d9bdba7a507e8c9.poster.avif?t=1749127555\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2455610/extras/7d315c4768a5b9755d9bdba7a507e8c9.webm?t=1749127555\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2455610/extras/7d315c4768a5b9755d9bdba7a507e8c9.mp4?t=1749127555\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2455610/extras/11ca3cc38e87e45dab528f152b402df6.poster.avif?t=1749127555\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2455610/extras/11ca3cc38e87e45dab528f152b402df6.webm?t=1749127555\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2455610/extras/11ca3cc38e87e45dab528f152b402df6.mp4?t=1749127555\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2>",
    "short_description": "Build your own Japanese castle, command your troops, and face epic battles in a cute crafted world based on real Japanese terrain. Featuring beloved characters like Zundamon and Kiritan, this strategy game blends history, humor, and tactical depth. No prior knowledge required\u2014just bring your wits!",
